### 1. Update the Font Preloads in `<head>`

Replace your old font preload lines with these:

```html
<link rel="preload" href="fonts/Sora-ExtraBold.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" href="fonts/Manrope-Regular.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>

```

